  "description": "The META POWER SX 400 ESSENTIAL is built to go the distance. Components are selected for reliability to let you stack up the runs.\n• FOX 38 Performance fork offers flawless performance. Easy to tune with a Grip cartridge and precise e-bike chassis. The Float X shock is dynamic and comfortable with a lockout for easier climbs.\n• Stopping power is managed by the progressive and consistent TRP DH-R EVO PRO brakes.\n• The combo of DT SWISS HF 1900 wheels and DT 370 hubs is reliable and ready for anything. Hand-built in Switzerland.\n• Built on the T-Type platform, the new SRAM Eagle 90 drivetrain is indestructible. It’s super versatile with a 520% gear range.",
